    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"embracing the emptiness and letting it consume you\"... that sounds so much more peaceful than fighting it. like, if i stop trying to pretend i'm still a whole person, maybe the weight will go away. but if i'm just a shadow, what's the point of the struggle? it feels like i'm just dragging this empty body around for no reason.",
